network adapters.  For more information on configuring  this  de‐
vice,  see  The following per‐interface variables are implemented
in the branch of the MIB.  Debug flags.  Channel dwell time  dur‐
ing  scan  (msec).  Firmware version.  Number of ticks before LED
enters idle state.  Allow LED to blink.  Enable software TX power
calibration.  The following cards are among  those  supported  by
